{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if the only way forward was up?<br>In <strong>Skies Scrapper</strong>, you wield a mysterious gravity gun that lets you lift, toss, and stack objects of all shapes and sizes. Pile furniture, crates, trees\u2014anything you can get your hands on\u2014to create towering structures that scrape the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you climb higher, you\u2019ll discover keys and glowing gems that upgrade your strength, allowing you to pick up bigger and stranger objects. Each new height reveals challenges, puzzles, and a story about what waits above the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your tower hold steady, or come tumbling down?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Gravity Gun Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Move, stack, and launch objects in creative ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Physics-Based Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Every climb is a balance of skill, creativity, and chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f <strong>Sandbox Creativity</strong> \u2013 No single solution\u2014experiment, build wild towers, and see what works.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Progression System</strong> \u2013 Collect gems to grow stronger and lift bigger objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Reach the Unknown</strong> \u2013 A mysterious story unfolds the higher you climb.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Casual &amp; Replayable</strong> \u2013 No two climbs are ever the same.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057030?t=1760319511","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057030?t=1760319511","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057030/85